{"id":9121924284547,"title":"Iron Man Transforming Robot Car  Alloy Toy For Boys With Crash-to-Transform Feature,Self-pickup Only.","price":999.0,"compare_at_price":1498.5,"image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/9404/4547/files/3f3c8402-7cea-4612-a58c-ea11267b219e.png?v=1782399237","subcategory":"Action & Toy Figures","category":"Toys, Kids & Babies","body_html":"\n <p>Unleash the superhero passion with our Iron Man Transforming Robot Car!Officially inspired by Marvel\u2019s iconic Iron Man, this crash-transformable alloy toy is a dream come true for young superhero fans aged 3-10.Simply let two cars collide or tap the transformation button, and the sleek racing car instantly turns into a mighty Iron Man robot-bringing the excitement of the Marvel universe right into kids\u2019 hands.</p>\n <p>Crafted with high-quality alloy material, the toy boasts exceptional sturdiness and drop resistance, standing up to energetic playtime.It\u2019s equipped with vivid sound and light effects: bright LED lights flash and heroic soundbites play during transformation and movement, creating an immersive gaming experience that stimulates kids\u2019 senses.The smooth-rolling wheels allow it to glide effortlessly on various surfaces, from carpets to wooden floors.</p>\n <p>Beyond fun, this toy fosters hand-eye coordination, imagination, and reaction skills. Perfect as a birthday, holiday, or reward gift, it\u2019s not just a toy but a collectible for little Iron Man enthusiasts. Safe, durable, and full of superhero charm, it\u2019s the ideal choice to spark joy and creative play in boys.</p>\n <p><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/fc66c3af-ff1b-4a93-aff2-1e48bfc1c929.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/24705e6b-5054-4ad0-9cf5-8d6d6c1cfe62.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/a41ddd8f-e213-4609-93b5-4698265a5815.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" conten